## 3. Mechanics

### Movement / platforming
_(TBD)_ — run, jump, grab-ledge as a baseline. Open: double-jump? wall-cling?
momentum/weight feel? Keep it tight and readable for an eerie-precision feel.

### Failure & respawn
_(TBD)_ — leaning **shared checkpoints**: if either player dies the pair
respawns together at the last checkpoint. Fits shared-screen and keeps both
invested. Open: instant-death hazards (Limbo-style) vs. health?

