## 6. Multiplayer / Technical — ✅ Local couch

- ✅ **Local co-op**, two players, one machine.
- **Camera (strong recommendation): shared single screen.** Forces players to
  stay together → natural cooperation pressure, and reads beautifully for an
  eerie silhouette style. (Alternative: split-screen — only if puzzles need
  players far apart. Flag if so.)
- [ ] Engine / tech stack
- [ ] Target platform(s)
- [ ] Control scheme (2 gamepads assumed)

---

## 7. Art & Audio Direction

Direction set by tone: **mysterious / eerie**.
- **Visual:** silhouette-forward, muted/desaturated palette, fog & depth,
  minimal-to-no on-screen UI. Readable shapes over detail.
- **Audio:** sparse ambient drone, diegetic sound, music that swells only at
  beats. Sound as a tension/telegraph tool.
- [ ] Lock palette & reference board
- [ ] Animation feel (weighty & vulnerable vs. nimble)

